<article class="legal-copy"><div class="legal-review">This page is an operational placeholder and requires review by a qualified legal adviser before public launch.</div><h2>Information you choose to send</h2><p>When you use a contact or wholesale form, the site records the details you submit so Raspina Clothing can respond. This may include your name, business, email, telephone, country, message and product shortlist.</p><h2>Technical safeguards</h2><p>The forms use session security, spam controls and limited technical request data to reduce abuse. The product shortlist is stored locally in your browser and is sent only when you submit an enquiry.</p><h2>Retention and requests</h2><p>Retention periods and formal privacy contact procedures must be confirmed before launch. Until then, contact <a href="mailto:<?= e(site_setting('site.email', $config['site']['email'])) ?>"><?= e(site_setting('site.email', $config['site']['email'])) ?></a> with questions about information you submitted.</p><h2>Third-party links</h2><p>Links to services such as Instagram or WhatsApp are governed by those services' own privacy terms.</p><p class="legal-updated">Draft updated: <?= date('F Y') ?></p></article>
